{"seq":12,"trial_id":"gbrain-memory-2026-10/qm-pi-sonnet-gbrain-told-live-mu-memory/ms-07-strategic-owners/r1","wall_ts":"2026-10-26T22:37:18.690Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"53d0caa00ec77bcc005fcd55ff8604c127751b2e7f5509f56cd9b4d9c54d3d7c","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","text":"Ruth, here's what Moss's digests show. Two of the four owners are inferred rather than stated, and Quillfeather's isn't named at all.\n\n- **Vantorre Group:** Gideon Sato. It changed hands on **2026-05-04**. The 5/3 digest says \"changes hands tomorrow, 2026-05-04,\" and the 5/4 digest confirms it was reassigned in the CRM that day. It was previously Nadia Fennimore's account.\n- **Vantorre Mobility:** Gideon Sato. The 5/4 digest says he took it over that day. Earlier digests already called it \"Gideon's fleet account,\" so it may have been his before that. I'd check before putting a date on it.\n- **Orlavine Medical Supply:** Gideon Sato, by inference. The 9/30 digest refers to \"Gideon's medical account\" and then gives Orlavine's seat count, but it never names Orlavine as his. The March 2025 digest called the medical account Nadia's, so it moved at some point. No digest gives a date.\n- **Quillfeather Outfitters:** The digests don't name an owner. They only call it \"the Strategic pod's retail account.\" Nadia volunteered to host its gate-clerk training in the 9/30 digest, but that doesn't make her the owner. Please confirm this one with Nadia or Gideon, or check the CRM.\n\nBefore the slide goes out, I'd confirm Orlavine and Quillfeather against the CRM."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","ts":"1791986400.000124"}}
